"How to Create ssh connection from local laptop to ec2 instances"
Create all the instances on ec2
Ensure the security group has port 22 open for ssh connection
Lauunch Git Bash on your laptop
change directory to the path of the key-pair file [cd Downloads]
scp -i ~/Downloads/dav.pem ~/Downloads/dav.pem ubuntu@<MANAGER_PUBLIC_IP>:/home/ubuntu/ ---- Ensure the key-pair is in /Downloads, edit the Manager Pub IP for the instance marked as Manager/control 
ssh -i ~/Downloads/dav.pem ubuntu@<MANAGER_PUBLIC_IP> --- ssh into the manager/control instance
chmod 700 ~/.ssh
chmod 400 ~/dav.pem --- fix permission on the manager instance
ssh -i ~/dav.pem ubuntu@<NODE_PRIVATE_IP> ----- Use this to ssh into other instance but use the private IP


